          "text": "Témoignages: GOURBIT (09) 28.06.2011",
          "text_sha256": "9108ce98e03fd6ab4aa2e9116cf03fdc55260b2d4db2a2ec9a210215e1727e37"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
